  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Short Term Consultancies for SWARIP</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Short Term Consultancies for SWARIP is a component of Support to West African Regional Integration Programme (SWARIP) reported by FCDO with a funding type of 104 - Procurement of Services and a budget of &#xa3;254,915. This project benefits Africa, regional. It works in the following sector(s): Trade facilitation, Trade policy and administrative management, Research/scientific institutions, Regional trade agreements (RTAs), Transport policy and administrative management, Multilateral trade negotiations, Women&apos;s rights organisations and movements, and government institutions.</narrative>
  </description>
